    "html": "<p>A satellite of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span> orbits a planet of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span> in a circular orbit of radius <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"r\"></span>. What is the work that must be done on the satellite to increase its orbital radius to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2r\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{GMm}{r}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{GMm}{2r}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{GMm}{4r}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{GMm}{8r}\"></span></li></ol>"
